يُستثنى من ذلك:
• خط Cairo في مجلد fonts — مرخّص برخصة SIL Open Font License (انظر fonts/OFL.txt).
• مكتبة Leaflet في مجلد vendor/leaflet — مرخّصة برخصة BSD-2-Clause (انظر vendor/leaflet/LICENSE).

Exceptions:
• The Cairo font in the fonts folder is licensed under the SIL Open Font License (see fonts/OFL.txt).
• Leaflet in vendor/leaflet is licensed under the BSD-2-Clause License (see vendor/leaflet/LICENSE).

